template_id: openagreements-online-business-asset-purchase-agreement
name: Online Business Asset Purchase Agreement
category: business-acquisition
description: >-
  Purchaser-oriented asset purchase agreement for an online or software business, with explicit
  schedules and negotiable elections. The company that owns the assets sells them, its individual
  owner signs for the obligations allocated to the owner, and Closing follows signing once the
  stated conditions are satisfied or waived. Every schedule and election must be completed for the
  transaction before signing.
