# Online Business Asset Purchase Agreement

{% agreement-section type="cover_terms" %}
## Key Terms

Capitalized Key Terms have the meanings below. Company sells assets. Seller is its individual owner. This Agreement becomes binding on the Agreement Date and Closing occurs later only when the stated conditions are satisfied or waived. Purchased Assets, Excluded Assets and Assumed Liabilities are defined under Definitions. The schedule index follows.

